{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "ab7046ed5ea8112a055dad644e1669a8defbdb5b8818b5171b9670eb42eef63c", "ja": "異例の転校生", "zh": "破例的转校生", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8fcc1d7dd0111e30ff2d560fa49b6a388a808a78dcadcc92ef3474188460de3f", "ja": "魔法学園きっての天才だが、パートナーが\n不在の可奈。その相棒が、人間界からやって\nきたばかりの女の子・翼に決まる。だが人の\n話をろくに聞かず、記念に自撮りをしたいと\n言い出す自由な翼に、可奈は不安しかない。", "zh": "魔法学园首屈一指的天才可奈一直没有搭档。后来，她的搭档被定为刚从人间界来到这里的女孩翼。然而，翼不怎么听别人说话，还提出想拍张自拍留念，这样随性的翼让可奈感到的只有不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "a4bd6fecc63af419c9a78fe37f1a449923daa6ab6af7b91224a37d04d1131660", "ja": "ええ～～～～っ！！？？", "zh": "诶～～～～！！？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "532b24ed4b0dff11ab4e6c1d2a4bed23921311de2799cde990ef6717f07f1f19", "ja": "朋花さん……じ、冗談ですよね！？\nこのニンゲンが、私のバディ……パートナーだなんて！", "zh": "朋花小姐……这、这是在开玩笑吧！？\n这个人类，居然是我的搭档……伙伴！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c6730bc1e33a15d16c307c403b4dd50cbabe725c23936b4026d8597a0fd978e", "ja": "？　あっ、ニンゲンってわたしのこと？\nはーい、ニンゲンの、伊吹翼でーす！", "zh": "？啊，你说的人类是我吗？好——我是人类伊吹翼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7592b98ee51bd217350bdc5d6a65ea767d305cb888f9c105cc2e0c395d9bc5bf", "ja": "なんか、魔法界のピンチだって聞いたから、\n急いで来たけど……全然、そんな感じしないね～？", "zh": "听说魔法界遇到危机了，所以我赶紧赶过来了，可是……完全感觉不到有那回事呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "b8c352e0cd6af51c9dacad9da67170414dd8026bf7928295b60ee65b7bb2d003", "ja": "冗談ではありません～。貴方も知ってのとおり、\n魔法使いには、パートナーが必要……。", "zh": "这可不是开玩笑哦～正如你所知，魔法师是需要搭档的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "23253aa2e7d3df00c7ebeef25cb1053705d7c911b4c5a4d06947453041f50a05", "ja": "貴方は、魔法学園きっての天才と謳われながら、\nいつまでもパートナーが不在ですしね～。", "zh": "您明明被誉为魔法学院首屈一指的天才，\n却一直都没有搭档呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "ea43af73a144bbfcb447b2c11024d6d6cd0423a5a727314df5d4498650c2f3c7", "ja": "それは……私の使う魔法には、危険が伴いますから！\n厳しい条件をクリアできないと……。", "zh": "那是因为……我使用的魔法伴随着危险！如果无法满足严苛的条件……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3597824134511b23d4beb2c526c337a6c19c764e78c7f0891014b9271b1af7c1", "ja": "未来先生か、杏奈先生レベルなら悪くないですね！", "zh": "如果是未来老师，或者杏奈老师那种水平的话，倒也不赖呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "40a827454f94f18d72e1c9423295be10336788d29d81aed9307a3e9d7395418f", "ja": "ふたりとも、学園でも指折りの魔法使いですね～。\nむしろ、貴方のほうが見合うかどうか……。", "zh": "两位都是学院里数一数二的魔法师呢～。\n倒不如说，是不是和您相称……都有待商榷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "6ba7399dc7e49010ed2f40495ae15b3b897f586c2272957b6e62c93fa0dc149a", "ja": "ぐっ……贅沢を言っているのはわかってます！\nけど、だからって……。", "zh": "呜……我知道自己是在奢求！  \n可是，就算这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4c1482c40072ed3729bed76f4a597ce76228d1a3b4bfb9d50c388f46b419b235", "ja": "へぇ～、魔法の世界って、こんな感じなんだ～。あっ、\nホントにホウキに乗ってる！　わたしも乗りた～い！", "zh": "哦～魔法的世界原来是这种感觉啊～。啊，真的骑在扫帚上！我也想骑～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d89e5176690a9c4d18c7bd9584d91386627c3765cf5e17261d7fcb1e3531b66", "ja": "もうこの時点で全然ダメ！　ダメダメのダメ！\nアンタ、話くらいちゃんと聞きなさいよ！", "zh": "从这一刻起就完全不行了！不行不行，绝对不行！\n你啊，好歹好好听人家把话说完吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ad1d870fbec8933637ae9f9547b1dd803ea4e4aef081d9c46d79615d57646fcc", "ja": "聞く聞く！　この世界のこと、もっと知りたいし♪\nあ、でもその前に、お願いがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "我听我听！我也想更多地了解这个世界♪ 啊，不过在那之前，我有个请求……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5b980495451f240920eb0d51af618dc3c3cea0f79c1745ce6ab73a9c8404b81", "ja": "……お願い？　な、なによ……。", "zh": "……请求？什、什么事啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "50b9bd012a9f519c2bbc9670b228d0734b50b3f472dd78a788152345f187fe87", "ja": "ホウキに乗せて～！　魔法の世界に来た記念に、\n一緒に空で自撮りしよ？　あ、動画のほうがいいかも？", "zh": "让我骑上扫帚嘛～！为了纪念来到魔法世界，\n一起在空中自拍吧？啊，拍视频可能更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_01_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "cebdef15f51ef92cc0265b0473100e76d317a1b0ee3e9882fd73eef78cee80e3", "ja": "……。嘘よ……これは嘘……。完璧で優秀な\n私の学園生活が、こんなことになるなんて……っ！！", "zh": "……骗人的……这是骗人的……我那完美又优秀的校园生活，怎么会变成这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
